00EÄ\000K\000Ä\000\000M\000\000\000WÅJ\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Raene's Cleansing\000\000ˇ\000\000\000\000\0001Find Shael'dryn at the moonwell to the northeast.\000\000\000k\000\000\000L\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Ä\000EÄ\0002\000Ä\000\000M\000\000\000\000\000ÅJ\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000An Aggressive Defense\000\000ˇ\000\000\000\000\000ÉKill 1 Den Watcher, 2 Ursas, 10 Totemics, and 12 Warriors of the Foulweald tribe, and then return to Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar.\000\000\000k\000\000\000k\000\000\000\000¢\000\000\000•\000\000\000¶\000\000\000ü\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Ä\000EÄ\000d\000Ä\000\000M\000\000\000\000\000ÅJ\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Raene's Cleansing\000\000\000\000\000\000\000c\000_Find the Wooden Key and a piece of Dartol's Rod before returning to Shael'dryn at the moonwell.\000\000\000L\000\000\000L\000\000\000\000\000\000X\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Ä\000EÄ\000d\000Ä\000\000M\000\000\000\000\000ÅJ\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Raene's Cleansing\000\000\000\000\000\000\000NFind the final piece of Dartol's Rod and return to Shael'dryn at the moonwell.\000\000\000L\000\000\000L\000\000\000\000\000\000è\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Ä\000EÄ\000d\000Ä\000\000M\000\000\000´ÅJ\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Raene's Cleansing\000\000\000\000\000\000\0003Find the hidden shrine and re-enchant Dartol's Rod.\000\000\000L\000\000\000\000JP\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000