er. Afterward, return to Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains, and inform Wildlord Antelarion of your success.\000\000\000Wó\000\000\000Vo\000\000\000\000M#\000\000\000\000|\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÄÆÄÙ\000?Ä@\000\000\000\000\000\000\000|çæ\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000*¢\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000An Improper Burial\000\000\000\000\000\000\000õCommander Ra'vaj at the Sha'tari Outpost in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest wants you to burn 8 Slain Auchenai Warriors and 8 Slain Sha'tar Vindicators.\000\000\000WÆ\000\000\000WÆ\000\000\000\000Uc&Slain Sha'tar Vindicator corpse burned\000UV$Slain Auchenai Warrior corpse burned\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÄÛÄ\000˙\000?Ä@\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000çæ\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000*£\000\000à\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000A Hero Is Needed\000\000*°\000\000\000\000\000ëCommander Ra'vaj at the Sha'tari Outpost in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest wants you to slay 12 Auchenai Initiates and 5 Auchenai Doomsayers.\000\000\000WÆ\000\000\000WÆ\000\000\000\000S$\000\000\000S%\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÄÛÄ\000˙\000?Ä@\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000çæ\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000à\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000The Fallen Exarch\000\000*¢\000\000\000\000\000àCommander Ra'vaj at the Sha'tari Outpost in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest wants you to destroy the contents of the Auchenai Coffin.\000\000\000WÆ\000\000\000WÆ\000\000\000\000W¥)Contents of the Auchenai Coffin destroyed\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÄÛÄ\000˙\000\000\000\000%Open the coffin and kill its contents\000\000\000“ß:Ä<\000\000M\000\000\000\000\000çö\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000à\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Digging for Prayer Beads\000\0