Áe\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000K\0004Dò\000\000\000\000\000dLight the Unlit Torch near a fire and use the Burning Torch to set the Archaeologist's Cart on fire.\000\000\000\000˛\000\000M\000\000\000\000¬\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000The Binding\000\000B\000\000\000ÊÍ\000âUsing the Wooden Figurine, summon and subdue an incubus, then return the Wooden Figurine to Gakin the Darkbinder in the Slaughtered Lamb.\000\000\000Í\000\000\000Í\000\000\000”˜\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Ô\000ƒ]\000\000\000\000\0008Use the Withered Scarf to summon an Incubus and slay it.\000\000\000\000˛\000\000≤\000\000\000\000¬\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000The Binding\000\000J\000\000\000=ÊÎ\000xUsing the Withered Scarf, summon and subdue an incubus, then return the Withered Scarf to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.\000\000\000Û\000\000\000Û\000\000\000”˜\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000e\000w‰˝\000\000\000\000\0008Use the Withered Scarf to summon an Incubus and slay it.\000\000\000\000˛\000\000≤\000\000\000\000¬\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000Wish You Were Here\000\000A\000\000\0009\000\000cInvestigate Fallen Sky Lake in Ashenvale and report your findings to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.\000\000\000\r#\000\000\000Û\000\000\000\000\000Á\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÄE\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000~„\000\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000Ä\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ˇˇ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000A Grand Delivery\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000˜\000O\000T\000U\000Z\000\000@Í\000Ac\000Dﬁ\000Jf\000K \000\000\000˜\000O\000T\000U\000Z